ida-mcp: ida_mcp.pro ported-runtime notice
==========================================

The ida_mcp.pro package ports the community server "ida-pro-mcp" onto the
official Hex-Rays ida-mcp server. Its runtime bundle
(ida_mcp/pro/runtime/) is derived from third-party, MIT-licensed code; this
notice carries the attribution and the license texts as required by both.

Source of truth for the port
----------------
Upstream project:  ida-pro-mcp (https://github.com/mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp)
Ported revision:  the installed ida_pro_mcp 2.0.0 wheel tree under
                   ida_pro_mcp/ida_mcp/ (12 api modules + utils + compat
                   + vendored _sigmaker engine).

