Scope of the port
----------------
Ported under MIT into this repository (also MIT, (c) Hex-Rays SA): the 95
@tool functions and 11 @resource handlers implemented by the runtime files,
their TypedDict result shapes (ida_mcp/pro/schemas.py), and the vendored
sigmaker engine. Porting was mechanical via artifacts_port/transform.py:
infra imports and decorators dropped, IDAError renamed to ProError, all tool
logic preserved. The server-side wrappers (tools.py, resources.py,
dispatch.py, bootstrap.py, spec.py) are original ida-mcp code.